{"unit":72,"section":3,"cefr":"A1","objective":"use verbal nouns","skill":"Verbal Nouns","heading":"Use verbal nouns","phrases":[{"he":"זאת הייתה קנייה חכמה.","en":"That was a smart purchase.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/e7276bef5fd4488215496ae689660b39","tokens":[{"w":"זאת","h":["this","that","this is (feminine)"]},{"w":"הייתה","h":["(she) was","was","(she) had been"]},{"w":"קנייה","h":["purchase (n)","purchase"]},{"w":"חכמה","h":["smart (sg. fem.)"]}]},{"he":"בישול הוא אמנות.","en":"Cooking is an art.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/70d968219abdb90d8e99b946ec50e575","tokens":[{"w":"בישול","h":["cooking"]},{"w":"הוא","h":["(he) is","(it) is","he"]},{"w":"אמנות","h":["art"]}]},{"he":"קיבלנו הזמנה לחתונה של בת הדודה שלי.","en":"We received an invitation to my cousin's wedding.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/a094a2fc1060aea19359617dacd7aa15","tokens":[{"w":"קיבלנו","h":["we received"]},{"w":"הזמנה","h":["invitation"]},{"w":"לחתונה","h":["to the wedding","for the wedding"]},{"w":"של","h":["'s","of"]},{"w":"בת","h":["the cousin","the female cousin","daughter","years old (sg. fem.)"]},{"w":"הדודה","h":["the cousin","the female cousin","the aunt"]},{"w":"שלי","h":["my","mine"]}]},{"he":"ההתנצלות לא תשנה כלום.","en":"The apology will change nothing.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/334c48a245178bb446c744b9447227da","tokens":[{"w":"ההתנצלות","h":["the apology"]},{"w":"לא","h":["not","didn't","doesn't"]},{"w":"תשנה","h":["(you) will change"]},{"w":"כלום","h":["nothing","not - anything"]}]}],"words":[{"he":"קנייה","en":"purchase","alt":["purchase (n)"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"חכמה","en":"smart (sg. fem.)","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"בישול","en":"cooking","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"אמנות","en":"art","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"קיבלנו","en":"we received","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"הזמנה","en":"invitation","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"לחתונה","en":"to the wedding","alt":["for the wedding"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"בת","en":"daughter","alt":["the cousin","the female cousin","years old (sg. fem.)"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"הדודה","en":"the aunt","alt":["the cousin","the female cousin"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"ההתנצלות","en":"the apology","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"זאת","en":"that","alt":["this","this is (feminine)"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"הייתה","en":"was","alt":["(she) was","(she) had been"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"הוא","en":"he","alt":["(he) is","(it) is"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"של","en":"'s","alt":["of"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"שלי","en":"my","alt":["mine"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"לא","en":"not","alt":["didn't","doesn't"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"תשנה","en":"(you) will change","alt":[],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"כלום","en":"nothing","alt":["not - anything"],"from":"phrase"}],"lexemes":["דרישה","האימון","הצפייה","הקנייה","לימוד","לאימון","התנצלות","לסיפור","למידה","הסיפורים","בקריאה","ריצה","הקריאה","הפתיחה","פתיחה","לריצה","שמיעה","למכירה","ההזמנה","הבישול","המכירה","הליכה","קריאה","בישול","השמיעה","הזמנה"],"tips":"In English, verbal nouns can be created by adding -ing to the verb. For example: reading and writing.\n\nIn Hebrew there are several such strategies, depending on the binyan of the verb.\n\n**Pa'al** verbs often follow the structure XXiXa:\n\nwriting (ktivá) כתיבה  \nbuying/purchase (kniyá) קנייה  \nthinking/thought (khashivá) חשיבה\n\n**Pi'el** verbs often follow the structure XiXuX:\n\ncooking (bishúl) בישול\n\n**Hiph'il** is usually haXXaXa:\n\norder (hazmaná) הזמנה\n\nAnd **hitpa'el**, hitXaXXut:\n\napology (hitnatslút) התנצלות"}